{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_01_end",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_01",
  "title": "闖入者",
  "storyCode": "SV-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f8e9ecae5aac9908799b8a1c944438acfa4aa9ff7e0046dfa94c27e0466368c7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你退步了，斯卡蒂。以前的你能輕輕鬆鬆地把他們大卸八塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何塞先生，我沒那麼血腥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難說。那就是你變了。你居然還給了他們逃的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是什麼風把你又吹到我這來了？他們在這蹲你是不是和我有關係？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說你不幹這行了，後面是加入了什麼......一個醫藥公司吧？好好的正經工作不幹，又跑來這荒郊野嶺做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何塞先生，你消息靈通。這次我需要你幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾年過去了，我還以為你收手了。因為你，卡西米爾的賞金獵人換了好幾批。這裡離卡西米爾那麼遠，我都能知道你又幹了些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本以為你是個只會搞大動靜的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但你現在變得這麼安靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這一路像拖車一樣從米諾斯附近碾過來，就為了找我？你想要什麼，說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要去鹽風城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鹽......風城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別告訴我，連你也沒聽過這地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，我聽過。在這一帶賣消息的人裡，也只有我聽過。但你，你怎麼會想去那裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那地方什麼都沒了。幾十年前......就不剩下什麼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "靠近大海的那一大塊，你以為還能剩下什麼？不過一個空架子，呼口氣都漏風。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很多賞金獵人想靠近那些荒棄的城市，就像撲向腐死馱獸骨架的小獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們以為還能摳出一絲能吃的血肉來，卻不知道自己吞進肚裡的不過是一包毒蟲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊比利亞。他們覺得這個不出聲的伊比利亞也像卡西米爾和高盧一樣，到處都是寶藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，那裡什麼都沒有。什麼都沒有的地方就越什麼都可能有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你會告訴賞金獵人什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們問我買消息，我會賣給他們。對我這樣的人來說，這些人回來或者回不來，都是生意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事實上，他們也確實回不來，一個都回不來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半個月前，有一隊人來找我，“匕首角”的手下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的裝備比地上這些小子要精良得多。他也很有經驗。他帶著十幾個人一起去了。現在再也沒人見過他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很多人好奇他們的下落。他們可能是被懲戒軍抓走，也可能是國防軍幹的，但我還聽說了別的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那裡有——怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要嘛就是被審判庭抓走了。我不知道哪種下場更慘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪物還是人，對我的劍來說區別不大。只分擋路的，和不擋路的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，好吧。你去鹽風城，總不能是想去度假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要去找人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又有哪個倒楣蛋惹到你了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這回不算。那人是我的......是我以前認識的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......比認識我還要早？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為他們都不在這，或者都死了。起碼你當年是這麼對我說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我才要去找。我要弄明白一些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你找了也挺多年了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上回那麼大動靜，不可能是為了那份騎士寶藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你跟我說過，人該往前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有沒有帶藏寶圖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很多人，有些還是老手。他們在荒地裡走，走著走著，就忘了自己要去哪，又想找什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們就一直走。不知饑餓，不知疲倦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......直到荒野將他們殺死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們太弱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弱？再強大的獵人，也征服不了沒有邊際的荒野。很多獵人不明不白地死在路上，到死都不知道自己要找什麼——這個結局不適合你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼要跟我說這些？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我難道沒和你說過，他們甚至都不是阿戈爾小機器的對手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你強，你保住我兒子的命了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要說對不起！我不是要刺你。我是要你自己想想，沒原諒你自己的是你，不是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我後悔的就只有沒打斷他的腿，不讓他走老子的老路。和你無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說自己是海裡來的，除了伊比利亞，我沒聽過其他什麼海。你是我不知道的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你呢，你就沒有不知道的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是那樣的人殺了我兒子。你都不知道的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我就是害怕那樣的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罷了。至少你說的人不會費盡心思殺我。你去鹽風城做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一個朋友被人帶去了那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿好。地圖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。我要給你什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給我什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你賣情報。一物換一物。你給了我資訊，我給你你需要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（彈煙灰）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想想......那年你把胡安那小子的屍體帶了回來，你把他交到了我手上，腦袋和胳膊還連在身體上。所以，現在我們就兩清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......何塞先生，非常感謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我走了。保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停！急急忙忙的，趕著去送死？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘿。你是不是沒怎麼聽過別人和你這麼說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你就需要有人這麼和你說說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你穿一身賞金獵人的衣服，就這麼大搖大擺地進伊比利亞的城市？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還真是老樣子啊，斯卡蒂。我費了這麼多口水，進你耳朵還不如嘩嘩的風聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這副模樣，國防軍能抓你十幾次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你準備跟他們耗多少時間？你要找的人又能等多少時間？伊比利亞人不是這些不入流的賞金獵人，沒那麼好打發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想給我建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還能借你一些東西。這琴你拿著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "琴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會彈嗎？我記得你以前彈過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那更好。不會彈也沒事，你就做做樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這衣服也換上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這是什麼衣服？樣子很怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你習不習慣不關鍵，伊比利亞人習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在開始，你就是流浪歌手斯卡蒂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去你想去的地方吧，歌手。沿著地圖，走水路，用不上多久就能到。你的話是能的，阿戈爾人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再見了，何塞先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老何塞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_181",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可別死在那。好歹死在認識的人旁邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibcoastn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救——救命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這都什麼東西......纏著、纏著我不放！怎麼砍都砍不死。海邊都是這種怪物嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿——走開，走開啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早知道我就不該來！*卡西米爾粗口*“黃煙”那廢物，要不是當年他沒本事中了圈套，老子能淪落到來這裡撿垃圾？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這*卡西米爾粗口*老子都快把命搭在這了！伊比利亞這鬼地方，名副其實的都是鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼、什麼情況？竟然一下把這怪物削成了泥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼。不管是啥，都讓老子撿了一條命——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，不能離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你又是誰？伊比利亞怎麼這麼多怪東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第二次。伊比利亞禁止傳謠。下次再開口，你需要更小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼啊？這打扮，這武器——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的天，你、你是......完了，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官，海邊清理乾淨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡已經沒有活人了——呃，除了這個站都站不住，身上正在發出一股難聞氣味的外來者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看到什麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大人，我什麼都沒做！我發誓，我、我只是迷路，我是不小心才進到這裡，我不是故意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您看，我這有金幣，還有別的東西，該死，很多都弄丟了......這些錢，裝備，全都給您，求您放過我吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收起你的破爛。長官問問題，不是叫你說這些廢話，外來者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "問題？什麼問題？大人，我不敢問問題......我沒有問題，我保證......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "求您了，大人，我不想......不要抓我......我還不如死了算了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當著我的面投海？你以為自己還來得及？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這劍......我的手......差一點......嗚呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，清醒些了嗎？你們這些雜草爛蟲一樣的外來人，心又貪又黑，卻總是這麼容易就嚇破了膽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......我不敢逃了，大人，我什麼都會說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好。我不喜歡重複問問題。所以，這是最後一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看到海邊有什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我......咳咳......我看到了怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們來了幾個人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來有十二......呃，算上嚮導，我們有十三個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官，他沒有撒謊。這些屍體我都在海邊找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你現在哭有什麼用？要不是你們闖入這裡，它們也不會找上你。違背律法的時候，就該想到代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，死了十二個人......這一路過來，它們的數量在變多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們並不會離巢穴太遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這說明長官的判斷是正確的。離得越近，它們越多。那座城鎮一定有問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "動身吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_182",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那這個人呢？他看到了很多不該看見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "饒、饒命！我能說的都說了！老爺，長官，大人......媽媽呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，看到什麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們約定過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道這樣的行為有什麼意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你答應過的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "答應？承諾，（軟體和骨骼的摩擦聲），諾言？之前被授予動作，之後就完成另些動作？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這樣要求，我回應。沒有約定，沒有承諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回應......當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尊貴的使者——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您願意回應，就已是我的榮耀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "aliases": [
        "斯卡蒂"
      ]
    }
